title = "MOSQUITO's Apprentice Test Campaign 2.0"
[Overview]
<background="nsstart">
So, young apprentice, you think you're good enough to be a <i>MOT</i><br> (<i>M</i>aster <i>O</i>f <i>T</i>echnology)? Not so fast...
you must first train before protecting the skies of Nimbus from the evil that lurks out there in multiplayer land.
<p>You are very fortunate. The Furies themselves are interested in teaching you the skills of the StormLords. Each 
battle has been carefully selected by the Gods to train you for the long and arduous battles that lie ahead. Succeed,
and the Gods will be extremely generous to you. Fail, and.... well, let's not talk about failure...<br><br>
                              Comments, suggestions? LET ME KNOW! <br>
